# The Five Minute Marketing Manager

**Product:** ArgusScout
**Live:** [argusscout.com](https://www.argusscout.com)

> Personal project. Built outside of work hours. Unrelated to my current employer.

A weekly AI-powered competitive intelligence tool for local small businesses. The product watches a customer's local market and emails them one prioritized recommendation per week, with evidence and a drafted response.

Currently in test mode. Onboarding 8 to 15 testers across multiple verticals to identify the strongest segment before commercializing.

## Built with

Next.js, Supabase, Vercel, Resend, and the Anthropic API.

## What I built

This is a solo project. I made every product, scope, and prioritization decision. I used Claude Sonnet 4.7 as a coding partner the way a PM uses an engineer: directing the work, reviewing the output, and rejecting what did not fit.

The production code is private. Happy to walk through the live application during a conversation.

